law currency_minor_units
claim the number of minor-unit digits of a currency, by its code; a code that is not listed is unknown
source ISO 4217 (a fixture of two currencies, for the money tests)
kind table
x-input code text
value e0 e2 unknown
row jpy: e0 when code == "JPY"
row usd: e2 when code == "USD"
otherwise unknown
